**Approved by:** Developer — YYYY-MM-DD
**Notes:** Prompts verbatim from Cursor transcript. Typos preserved.
```

### 4. Update prompt-history/README.md
Add a row to the Session Index table:
`| X.X — <Title> | [sprint-X.X.md](sprint-X.X.md) | YYYY-MM-DD | Verbatim (transcript) — Approved |`

## Honesty Rule
- Never fabricate prompts. If transcript unreadable: "Transcript unavailable — prompts reconstructed from outcomes only."
- Never invent AI output. Summarize only what actually appeared.
- Preserve original typos in user prompts — evidence of real input.
- Do not create the file before Quality Gate passes.
